---
import Layout from "../layouts/layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="now">
    <div class="page">
        <h1>/now</h1>
        <p class="updated">updated june 2026</p>

        <p>This is a snapshot of what I'm doing right now. Updated whenever things change enough to be worth noting.</p>

        <h2>working on</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>revising for exams :/</li>
            <li>helping to establish the uni of sheffield microcontroller hackerspace</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>current interests</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>irc / rss / "obsolete" technologies</li>
            <li>linux and self-hosting</li>
            <li>astrophotography</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>reading</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>atomic habits - james clear</li>
            <li>the let them theory - mel robbins</li>
            <li>voyage - steven baxter</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>thinking about</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>linear algebra (not for long!)</li>
            <li>making the website more personal</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
            Inspired by <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                >the /now movement</a
            >.
        </p>
    </div>
</Layout>

<style>
    .page {
        max-width: 700px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .updated {
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .page h1 {
        margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    h2 {
        margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    a {
        color: var(--text);
    }
</style>
